<p>Every platform crops differently, but the parts never change: a photo, a word with the red dot, a chip, a hand note. Pick the canvas for the platform, then pick the type from the promise — exactly as for <a href="/concept/thumbnails/types/">thumbnails</a>.</p>

<h2 id="sizes">Every size</h2>
